@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<article class="legal">
    <header class="legal-header">
        <span class="badge-soft badge-soft-primary">Legal</span>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-meta">Effective 26 October 2026 · Applies to the e-Dhaq website and the e-Dhaq Laundry apps for Android and iOS</p>
    </header>

    <p class="lead">e-Dhaq ("we", "us") is a laundry pickup and delivery service based in Garowe, Puntland, Somalia. This policy explains what information we collect, why we collect it, and the choices you have.</p>

    <nav class="legal-toc" aria-label="Contents">
        <a href="#collect">Information we collect</a>
        <a href="#use">How we use it</a>
        <a href="#share">Who we share it with</a>
        <a href="#payments">Payments</a>
        <a href="#retention">Storage &amp; retention</a>
        <a href="#rights">Your choices &amp; rights</a>
        <a href="#delete">Deleting your account</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact us</a>
    </nav>

    <section id="collect">
        <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
        <h3>Information you give us</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Account details:</strong> your first and last name, email address, phone number and password (stored only as a secure hash, never in plain text).</li>
            <li><strong>Addresses:</strong> the pickup and delivery addresses you save, including city, village/district and street.</li>
            <li><strong>Orders:</strong> the laundry services and quantities you order, special instructions, schedules, coupons and order history.</li>
            <li><strong>Support messages:</strong> anything you send us when you contact support.</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Information collected when you use the service</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Delivery records:</strong> order status updates and, where a driver takes one, a photo as proof of delivery.</li>
            <li><strong>Driver location:</strong> for drivers only, location is shared while a pickup or delivery is in progress so customers can track their order. We do not track customers' location.</li>
            <li><strong>Notifications:</strong> the in-app notifications we send you about your orders.</li>
            <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> basic server logs (such as IP address, device/browser type and error reports) used to keep the service secure and working.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The app may ask for camera or photo library access only for features that need it, such as delivery proof photos. You can refuse or change these permissions at any time in your device settings.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="use">
        <h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>To create and secure your account, including sending password reset codes to your email.</li>
            <li>To schedule pickups, process your laundry and deliver it back to you.</li>
            <li>To send you order updates and service notifications.</li>
            <li>To record payments and provide receipts.</li>
            <li>To provide customer support and resolve problems.</li>
            <li>To prevent fraud and abuse, and to meet legal obligations.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal information, and we do not use it for third-party advertising.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="share">
        <h2>3. Who we share it with</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Our drivers and laundry staff</strong> see the details needed to complete your order — your name, phone number, address and order items.</li>
            <li><strong>Service providers</strong> who host our servers and database and send our emails, only as needed to run the service.</li>
            <li><strong>Authorities</strong>, if we are required to by law or to protect the safety of our customers, staff or the public.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="payments">
        <h2>4. Payments</h2>
        <p>You pay on delivery. Your driver collects payment in cash or by mobile money (such as EVC Plus, ZAAD, eDahab, Sahal or MyCash). We record the amount, the payment method, and any mobile-money transaction ID you provide. We do <strong>not</strong> collect or store card numbers, mobile-money PINs or bank passwords.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="retention">
        <h2>5. Storage, security &amp; retention</h2>
        <p>Your information is stored on secure cloud servers and sent over encrypted (HTTPS) connections. Access is limited to staff who need it to do their jobs. We keep your account information while your account is active, and order and payment records for as long as needed for accounting and legal purposes. No system is perfectly secure, but we work to protect your data and will notify you if a breach affects you.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="rights">
        <h2>6. Your choices &amp; rights</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Access and correct:</strong> you can view and edit your name, email and phone number at any time in the Profile section of the app or website.</li>
            <li><strong>Notifications:</strong> you can turn off push notifications in your device settings.</li>
            <li><strong>Permissions:</strong> you can withdraw camera, photo or location permissions in your device settings.</li>
            <li><strong>Questions or requests:</strong> contact us and we will respond within 30 days.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="delete">
        <h2>7. Deleting your account</h2>
        <p>You can ask us to delete your account and personal data at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:support@edhaq.com?subject=Delete%20my%20account">support@edhaq.com</a> from the email address on your account, with the subject "Delete my account". We will delete or anonymize your data within 30 days, except records we must keep by law, such as completed payment records.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>8. Children</h2>
        <p>e-Dhaq is not intended for children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their personal information.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy from time to time. We will post the new version on this page and change the effective date above. For significant changes, we will notify you in the app.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
        <h2>10. Contact us</h2>
        <p>e-Dhaq · Garowe, Puntland, Somalia<br />
            Email: <a href="mailto:support@edhaq.com">support@edhaq.com</a><br />
            Help centre: <a asp-page="/Support">Support</a></p>
    </section>
</article>
